# ============================================================
# MRPG (Unreal Engine 5.8) - Git Ignore
# Lean template policy: track code/Config/specs + core Content
# (Blueprints, Levels, Input, Widgets, Audio, AI_MCP).
# Heavy Epic sample data (Characters, MetaHumans, Movies,
# IsolatedExamples) is intentionally EXCLUDED from source control.
# ============================================================

# ---- Unreal Engine generated ----
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Logs/
Cached/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# ---- Heavy Epic sample content (keep repo lean / within LFS quota) ----
/Content/Characters/
/Content/MetaHumans/
/Content/Movies/
/Content/IsolatedExamples/

# ---- Editor / IDE ----
.vs/
.idea/
/Content/Developers/
/Content/Collections/
DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Compile-command artifacts regenerated by the engine
.vscode/compileCommands_Default*.json
.vscode/compileCommands_MRPG*.json
.vscode/compileCommands_Default/
.vscode/compileCommands_MRPG/